    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Covenant Level, Breakthrough, and Rewards】</>\nAfter joining a Covenant, you start at Level 1 by default. Obtain Action Points through Covenant gameplay; once the requirements are met, you can increase your level.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Breakthrough Quests:</>\nFor some levels, you must complete a Breakthrough Quest after reaching the required Action Points. Action Points will continue to accumulate while the Breakthrough Quest is incomplete. Once completed, your level can continue to increase.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Claiming Rewards:</>\nYou can claim rewards directly in the level rewards interface.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[教团行动值与周上限]|1276}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Covenant Level, Breakthrough, and Rewards】</>\nAfter joining a Covenant, you start at Level 1 by default. Obtain Action Points through Covenant gameplay; once the requirements are met, you can increase your level.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Breakthrough Quests:</>\nFor some levels, you must complete a Breakthrough Quest after reaching the required Action Points. Action Points will continue to accumulate while the Breakthrough Quest is incomplete. Once completed, your level can continue to increase.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Claiming Rewards:</>\nYou can claim rewards directly in the level rewards interface.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Covenant Action Points and Weekly Cap]|1276}",
    ["<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nThe 【Club Brawl】 event you participated in has ended. You placed <M_Orange>3</> in this competition. Among them, the phantom projection <M_Orange>丫人</> you summoned scored the highest, with a cumulative score of <M_Orange>163</> points, and <M_Orange>无阳光</> defeated the most, with a cumulative total of <M_Orange>5</> projections defeated."] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nThe 【Club Brawl】 event you participated in has ended. You placed <M_Orange>3</> in this competition. Among them, the phantom projection <M_Orange>Ya Ren</> you summoned scored the highest, with a cumulative score of <M_Orange>163</> points, and <M_Orange>No Sunlight</> defeated the most, with a cumulative total of <M_Orange>5</> projections defeated.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n您所在的俱乐部已被邀请加入盛大的贸易战争，您所在的俱乐部将获得以下站点的管理权：%s，利用好他们，在贸易战争中让廷根再次伟大吧！"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\nYour club has been invited to join the grand Trade War. Your club will gain management rights over the following sites: %s. Make good use of them and Make Tingen Great Again in the Trade War!",
